A targeted look at the pathway the hypothesis is about, independent of whether these genes survive genome-wide correction.

10.1 Detection check: read this before interpreting anything below
Pre-filtering silently removes genes, so before asking “is AR differentially expressed?” we must ask “is AR detected at all?”. This table reports raw counts for every pathway gene before filtering.


